<title>JAPAN: Matsushita Communication slips on downgrading.</title>
<headline>Matsushita Communication slips on downgrading.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Matsushita Communication Industrial Co Ltd fell sharply after Nomura Research Institute Ltd downgraded the firm to a &quot;2&quot; rating from its previous &quot;1&quot;, brokers said.</p>
<p>As of 0045 GMT, the shares were down 120 yen at 3,040 yen.  </p>
<p>The issue ranked seventh in the list of top percentage losers in early morning trade on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
